---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="StickLink Golf — The round keeps going" description="StickLink Golf connects golfers, courses, and physical touchpoints into a living round passport. Tap the flag, play the moment, and keep the hole.">
  <section class="hero shell home-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">AI-NATIVE GOLF NETWORK / BUILT FOR THE REAL WORLD</div>
      <h1>THE ROUND<br /><span>KEEPS GOING.</span></h1>
      <p>State of Stick Golf connects the physical course, the player, and the next useful moment—turning every round into a living record worth returning to.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/round/cedar-ridge/">Enter a live round <span>↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/network/">Explore network</a></div>
      <ul class="hero-capabilities" aria-label="Golf network capabilities"><li>/ PHYSICAL TOUCHPOINTS</li><li>/ PERSISTENT IDENTITY</li><li>/ COURSE INTELLIGENCE</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-product-stage">
      <div class="hero-product-label">CONNECTED FAIRWAY / 001</div>
      <div class="round-card">
      <img class="hero-art" src="/art/golf-fairway-hero.png" alt="Golden-hour golf fairway with a brushed metal course emblem" />
      <div class="card-top"><span>ACTIVE ROUND / 08.19.26</span><span>● LIVE</span></div>
      <h2>Cedar Ridge Golf Club</h2><p>Maple City, Michigan · Member guest</p>
      <div class="hole"><div><span>UP NEXT</span><br /><strong>Hole 07 · Par 3</strong></div><div class="tap-mark">TAP<br />TO PLAY</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-product-note"><span>THE PHYSICAL LAYER</span><strong>Tap the flag.<br />Keep the hole.</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="stripe shell"><span><strong>01</strong> PHYSICAL TOUCHPOINTS</span><span><strong>02</strong> GOLFER PASSPORT</span><span><strong>03</strong> COURSE INTELLIGENCE</span></div>
  <section class="tap-story shell home-dark-section">
    <div class="tap-story-art">
      <img src="/art/flagstick-tap-medallion.png" alt="Engraved golf medallion mounted to a flagstick beside the cup" />
      <span class="tap-story-stamp">HOLE 07 · PAR 3</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tap-story-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">THE FIRST GOLF-NATIVE INTERFACE</div>
      <h2>Tap the flag.<br /><em>Keep the hole.</em></h2>
      <p>The course gets a physical moment worth touching. A small numbered medallion on the flagstick lets a golfer tap in, open the hole, verify the round, save a memory, or unlock what is waiting at the green.</p>
      <div class="tap-story-points"><span>01 / TOUCH</span><span>02 / PLAY</span><span>03 / REMEMBER</span></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/round/cedar-ridge/">See the live round <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section shell home-dark-section home-features">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ONE LAYER, MANY MOMENTS</div><h2>Make the course<br />speak for itself.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">A tap at the tee box. A badge after the round. A sponsor experience that can finally show what happened. No heavy app download required.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature"><span class="number">01 / TOUCH</span><div><h3>Tap into the moment</h3><p>Tee markers, carts, halfway houses, pro shops, and tournament signs become useful at exactly the right time.</p></div></article>
      <article class="feature"><span class="number">02 / REMEMBER</span><div><h3>Keep the memory</h3><p>A golfer-owned passport collects rounds, achievements, course emblems, and the stories behind them.</p></div></article>
      <article class="feature"><span class="number">03 / GROW</span><div><h3>Build the next visit</h3><p>Course operators can see participation, repeat visits, offers, and activations—and turn a good round into a reason to return.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-showcase home-dark-section">
    <div class="shell showcase-inner">
      <div class="showcase-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR THE FULL ROUND</div>
        <h2>One physical layer.<br /><em>Every reason to return.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="showcase-grid">
        <article class="showcase-card showcase-card-featured">
          <div class="showcase-index">01 / THE GOLFER</div>
          <div><strong>Keep the story.</strong><p>Rounds, courses, moments, and achievements stay together in a passport that belongs to the player.</p></div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/passport/">Open the passport <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="showcase-card">
          <div class="showcase-index">02 / THE COURSE</div>
          <div><strong>Make the place useful.</strong><p>Approved context and service moments appear exactly where a golfer needs them.</p></div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/course/cedar-ridge/">See the course <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="showcase-card">
          <div class="showcase-index">03 / THE OPERATOR</div>
          <div><strong>See what happened.</strong><p>Participation, requests, and repeat behavior become a clearer operating picture.</p></div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/operator/">View operator tools <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="showcase-footer"><span>STATE OF STICK / GOLF</span><span>DEMONSTRATION EXPERIENCE · 2026</span><span>PHYSICAL THINGS, LIVING STORIES.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
